{"unit_id":"try-works__dsh-stt#card-zh","repo":"try-works/dsh-stt","commit":"0a594802487289a294b836312d75fc0daf567935","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-stt 是面向 DSH Web composer 的本地语音转文字插件，通过接入 DSH 的 speechToText provider 注册表并在输入框活动栏加入录音控件，让用户用语音起草消息。它提供 Whistle 和 Voz 两种可选识别模型，支持静音自动结束录音、模型按需下载、转录结果插入草稿，以及较长录音分段处理。录音经本地识别后只写入当前草稿，用户仍需自行发送。适合希望在 DSH 网页端免手动输入、并在 Host 本机运行语音识别的用户。首次使用需在设置中选择并准备模型；Voz 模型下载体积较大。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:13-35","src/client/index.js:127-169","src/client/index.js:414-460","src/providers/whistle/spec.js:301-321"]}
{"unit_id":"try-works__dsh-stt#card-en","repo":"try-works/dsh-stt","commit":"0a594802487289a294b836312d75fc0daf567935","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-stt adds local speech-to-text to the DSH Web composer. It registers Whistle and Voz and adds a microphone control. Silence can end recording automatically; transcripts go into the draft. Models are prepared on demand, and long recordings can be split. Choose a model before dictating.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:13-35","src/client/index.js:127-169","src/client/index.js:414-460","src/providers/whistle/spec.js:301-321"]}
